cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Species Distribution Modelling Pipeline for Iberian Bats"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible SDM pipeline for 29 bat species of the Iberian Peninsula
  and Balearic Islands at UTM 10x10 km resolution. Combines environmental
  GLMs, spatial GAMs, fuzzy intersection, and multi-source uncertainty,
  with variable selection guided by a two-axis ecological guild system.
version: 2.1.0
date-released: 2026-04-22
